### Suspicious Behavior Detection API - Live Testing File
# This file can be used with VS Code REST Client or any HTTP client to quickly test your FastAPI endpoints.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Get System Status and Configuration
# Verifies if the FastAPI AI Inference server is running, checks active configurations
# (DEVICE_MODE, timing periods, thresholds), and confirms whether the ResNet+LSTM model is loaded.
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Live MJPEG Annotated Video Feed
# Streams the live camera or video file with real-time YOLO bounding boxes, ByteTrack IDs,
# and sliding-window ResNet+LSTM behavior classification overlay labels.
# (Cancel request manually in client to close stream)
GET {{baseUrl}}/video
Accept: multipart/x-mixed-replace
